# {{.AppName}}

{{if .Minimal}}`fxkit.Minimal()` + Huma.{{else}}`fxkit.Default()` + Huma.{{end}}

## Run

From the **repo root**:

```bash
make run SVC={{.AppName}}
# or
go run ./services/{{.AppName}}/cmd serve --config services/{{.AppName}}/configs/config.yaml
```

- `GET /greet/{name}` — sample Huma handler
- `GET /docs` — Scalar API reference
- `GET /healthz` — liveness

Dump OpenAPI (no HTTP listen) and generate a typed Go client:

```bash
make openapi SVC={{.AppName}}
fxkit gen client --spec services/{{.AppName}}/openapi.yaml --out ./internal/clients/{{.AppName}}
```
